1. Simple Input Fields (No options, basic HTML inputs)
text - Single line text input

email - Email address input

password - Password input (masked)

number - Numeric input

tel - Telephone number input

url - URL/website input

search - Search field input

color - Color picker input

file - File upload input

image - Image upload input

hidden - Hidden field (no UI)

textarea - Multi-line text area

2. Date/Time Inputs (Calendar/Time pickers)
date - Date picker

time - Time picker

datetime-local - Combined date and time

month - Month/year picker

week - Week picker

3. Option-Based Selection Fields (Require options array)
radio - Radio button group (single selection)

checkbox - Checkbox group (multiple selection)

singleSelect - Dropdown select (single selection)

multipleSelect - Multi-select dropdown (multiple selection)

4. Dynamic/Conditional Fields (Special behavior)
dynamicSingleSelect - Dynamic options with scenario blocks

Conditional fields (any type with dependsOn/condition attributes)

5. Action/Button Fields
submit - Form submission button

reset - Form reset button

button - Generic button (custom actions)

image - Can also function as submit button

6. Specialized Input Types
range - Slider input (not in example but supported)

color - Color picker (already listed but specialized)

Testing Priority Groups:
Group 1: Simple inputs (text, email, password, number)
Group 2: Option-based fields (radio, checkbox, singleSelect, multipleSelect)
Group 3: Date/time inputs (date, time, datetime-local)
Group 4: Special types (file, textarea, hidden)
Group 5: Complex types (dynamicSingleSelect, conditional fields)
Group 6: Action fields (submit, reset)

This covers all field types shown in your Formique schema with logical grouping for systematic testing.

